          "action": "translate"
        },
        {
          "node": 4,
          "part": "tail",
          "source": ". Kartan may be a contraction of this. Cheyne (EB, under the word) suggests that both names may be corruptions from \"Chinnereth.\" Neither is mentioned in ",
